{"parentUuid":"20b5ff30-5cde-4842-a1b3-27bc0b93a99c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7e458622-6f79-47dd-b3f1-3f9af9e69c98","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01A3GNjA62n83VgmLfWx5xVR","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t<!DOCTYPE html>\n2\t<html lang=\"zh-TW\">\n3\t<head>\n4\t  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n5\t  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n6\t  <title>大樹教練 吳大樹 ｜ 有效溝通就是無價之寶</title>\n7\t  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"大樹教練吳大樹，投入教育25年，演講超過5,000場，足跡遍及台灣、新加坡、馬來西亞及中國大陸。海餅乾俱樂部創辦人，BNI大台南南區執行董事，頂級特助系統創建者。\" />\n8\t  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n9\t  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n10\t  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;700;900&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\" />\n11\t  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n12\t</head>\n13\t<body>\n14\t\n15\t  <!-- 導覽列 -->\n16\t  <header class=\"navbar\" id=\"navbar\">\n17\t    <div class=\"container nav-inner\">\n18\t      <a href=\"#\" class=\"logo\">\n19\t        <span class=\"logo-main\">大樹教練</span>\n20\t        <span class=\"logo-sub\">吳大樹 DA SHU COACH</span>\n21\t      </a>\n22\t      <nav class=\"nav-links\">\n23\t        <a href=\"#about\">關於教練</a>\n24\t        <a href=\"#timeline\">創業歷程</a>\n25\t        <a href=\"#services\">服務項目</a>\n26\t        <a href=\"#courses\">線上課程</a>\n27\t        <a href=\"#speaking\">企業演講</a>\n28\t        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn-nav\">立即聯繫</a>\n29\t      </nav>\n30\t      <button class=\"hamburger\" id=\"hamburger\" aria-label=\"選單\">\n31\t        <span></span><span></span><span></span>\n32\t      </button>\n33\t    </div>\n34\t    <div class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobileMenu\">\n35\t      <a href=\"#about\">關於教練</a>\n36\t      <a href=\"#timeline\">創業歷程</a>\n37\t      <a href=\"#services\">服務項目</a>\n38\t      <a href=\"#courses\">線上課程</a>\n39\t      <a href=\"#speaking\">企業演講</a>\n40\t      <a href=\"#contact\">立即聯繫</a>\n41\t    </div>\n42\t  </header>\n43\t\n44\t  <!-- Hero -->\n45\t  <section class=\"hero\">\n46\t    <div class=\"hero-bg\"></div>\n47\t    <div class=\"container hero-content\">\n48\t      <p class=\"hero-tag\">投入教育 25 年｜演講超過 5,000 場</p>\n49\t      <h1 class=\"hero-title\">有效溝通<br><span class=\"gold\">就是無價之寶</span></h1>\n50\t      <p class=\"hero-desc\">\n51\t        協助每一個生命值得更好的人<br>\n52\t        在人生每個階段，找到自我價值、展現最佳狀態\n53\t      </p>\n54\t      <div class=\"hero-btns\">\n55\t        <a href=\"#courses\" class=\"btn-gold\">探索線上課程</a>\n56\t        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn-line\">邀約演講培訓</a>\n57\t      </div>\n58\t    </div>\n59\t    <div class=\"scroll-hint\"><span></span></div>\n60\t  </section>\n61\t\n62\t  <!-- 痛點 -->\n63\t  <section class=\"pain\" id=\"pain\">\n64\t    <div class=\"container\">\n65\t      <p class=\"tag center\">你是否也面臨這樣的困境？</p>\n66\t      <div class=\"pain-grid\">\n67\t        <div class=\"pain-card\">\n68\t          <div class=\"pain-icon\">💼</div>\n69\t          <h3>職場瓶頸</h3>\n70\t          <p>努力工作卻晉升無望，不知道如何突破職涯天花板？</p>\n71\t        </div>\n72\t        <div class=\"pain-card\">\n73\t          <div class=\"pain-icon\">🗣️</div>\n74\t          <h3>溝通障礙</h3>\n75\t          <p>開口說話就緊張，人際關係複雜，無法有效表達自己？</p>\n76\t        </div>\n77\t        <div class=\"pain-card\">\n78\t          <div class=\"pain-icon\">📉</div>\n79\t          <h3>業績低迷</h3>\n80\t          <p>銷售屢屢碰壁，客戶一再拒絕，找不到開單的核心關鍵？</p>\n81\t        </div>\n82\t        <div class=\"pain-card\">\n83\t          <div class=\"pain-icon\">🔍</div>\n84\t          <h3>迷失方向</h3>\n85\t          <p>不清楚自己的優勢與潛能，不知道該往哪個方向前進？</p>\n86\t        </div>\n87\t      </div>\n88\t    </div>\n89\t  </section>\n90\t\n91\t  <!-- 數據條 -->\n92\t  <section class=\"stats\">\n93\t    <div class=\"container stats-grid\">\n94\t      <div class=\"stat-item\">\n95\t        <span class=\"stat-num\" data-target=\"25\">0</span><span class=\"stat-unit\">年</span>\n96\t        <span class=\"stat-label\">培訓教育資歷</span>\n97\t      </div>\n98\t      <div class=\"stat-item\">\n99\t        <span class=\"stat-num\" data-target=\"5000\">0</span><span class=\"stat-unit\">+ 場</span>\n100\t        <span class=\"stat-label\">演講場次</span>\n101\t      </div>\n102\t      <div class=\"stat-item\">\n103\t        <span class=\"stat-num\" data-target=\"100000\">0</span><span class=\"stat-unit\">+ 人</span>\n104\t        <span class=\"stat-label\">受益學員</span>\n105\t      </div>\n106\t      <div class=\"stat-item\">\n107\t        <span class=\"stat-num\" data-target=\"4\">0</span><span class=\"stat-unit\">地</span>\n108\t        <span class=\"stat-label\">台灣・新馬・中國大陸</span>\n109\t      </div>\n110\t    </div>\n111\t  </section>\n112\t\n113\t  <!-- 關於教練 -->\n114\t  <section class=\"about\" id=\"about\">\n115\t    <div class=\"container about-inner\">\n116\t      <div class=\"about-photo\">\n117\t        <img\n118\t          src=\"https://www.bymyway.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/dashu-coach-profile.jpg\"\n119\t          alt=\"大樹教練 吳大樹\"\n120\t          onerror=\"this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'\"\n121\t        />\n122\t        <div class=\"photo-fallback\">大樹<br>教練</div>\n123\t        <div class=\"photo-badge\">零負評<br>培訓講師</div>\n124\t      </div>\n125\t      <div class=\"about-text\">\n126\t        <p class=\"tag\">關於大樹教練</p>\n127\t        <h2>吳大樹<br><span class=\"gold\">具有使命感的教育家</span></h2>\n128\t        <blockquote>\n129\t          「每次課程都要將最好的訊息，帶給每一個生命值得更好的人。」\n130\t        </blockquote>\n131\t        <p>大樹教練投入教育二十五年，洞悉人性，深耕人際關係與自我成長領域。演講足跡遍佈臺灣、中國大陸主要城市、馬來西亞、新加坡，受益學員超過十萬人次。</p>\n132\t        <p>業界少數<strong>零負評培訓講師</strong>，用最淺白的語言與啟發的方式，引導學員找到根源性問題的解決方案。</p>\n133\t\n134\t        <div class=\"identity-tags\">\n135\t          <span>🎯 海餅乾俱樂部創辦人（2007）</span>\n136\t          <span>🏢 BNI 大台南南區執行董事</span>\n137\t          <span>📚 人才培育系統創辦人</span>\n138\t        </div>\n139\t\n140\t        <div class=\"about-skills\">\n141\t          <span>有效溝通</span>\n142\t          <span>人際關係</span>\n143\t          <span>發現潛能</span>\n144\t          <span>突破設限</span>\n145\t          <span>銷售力</span>\n146\t        </div>\n147\t        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn-gold\">與大樹教練聯繫</a>\n148\t      </div>\n149\t    </div>\n150\t  </section>\n151\t\n152\t  <!-- 創業歷程 -->\n153\t  <section class=\"timeline\" id=\"timeline\">\n154\t    <div class=\"container\">\n155\t      <p class=\"tag center\">創業歷程</p>\n156\t      <h2 class=\"section-title center\">從 1997 年至今<br><span class=\"gold\">27 年的創業與教育之路</span></h2>\n157\t      <div class=\"timeline-track\">\n158\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n159\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">1997</span>\n160\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n161\t            <h4>尋易電信</h4>\n162\t            <p>店東｜踏上創業之路</p>\n163\t          </div>\n164\t        </div>\n165\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n166\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">1998</span>\n167\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n168\t            <h4>叢林美工廣告股份有限公司</h4>\n169\t            <p>業務副總</p>\n170\t          </div>\n171\t        </div>\n172\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n173\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">1999</span>\n174\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n175\t            <h4>陳安之研究訓練機構</h4>\n176\t            <p>課程助教／助理講師｜正式踏入教育培訓領域</p>\n177\t          </div>\n178\t        </div>\n179\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n180\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2002</span>\n181\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n182\t            <h4>中華數位教育發展協會</h4>\n183\t            <p>秘書長</p>\n184\t          </div>\n185\t        </div>\n186\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n187\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2005</span>\n188\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n189\t            <h4>心想事成國際股份有限公司</h4>\n190\t            <p>共同創辦人</p>\n191\t          </div>\n192\t        </div>\n193\t        <div class=\"tl-item highlight\">\n194\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2007</span>\n195\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n196\t            <h4>海餅乾俱樂部</h4>\n197\t            <p>創辦人｜一個使命，三大信念，十條守則</p>\n198\t          </div>\n199\t        </div>\n200\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n201\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2015</span>\n202\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n203\t            <h4>桃園東陽扶輪社</h4>\n204\t            <p>創始會員／節目主委</p>\n205\t          </div>\n206\t        </div>\n207\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n208\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2016</span>\n209\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n210\t            <h4>希望之聲全球廣播電臺</h4>\n211\t            <p>節目企劃</p>\n212\t          </div>\n213\t        </div>\n214\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n215\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2017</span>\n216\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n217\t            <h4>大樹教育顧問有限公司</h4>\n218\t            <p>創辦人</p>\n219\t          </div>\n220\t        </div>\n221\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n222\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2018</span>\n223\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n224\t            <h4>聚寶盆商業顧問有限公司</h4>\n225\t            <p>創辦人</p>\n226\t          </div>\n227\t        </div>\n228\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n229\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2018</span>\n230\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n231\t            <h4>BNI 大台南南區</h4>\n232\t            <p>執行董事</p>\n233\t          </div>\n234\t        </div>\n235\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n236\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2022</span>\n237\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n238\t            <h4>中華中小企業跨業交流協會</h4>\n239\t            <p>常務監事</p>\n240\t          </div>\n241\t        </div>\n242\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n243\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2023</span>\n244\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n245\t            <h4>大臺南生命線協會</h4>\n246\t            <p>總幹事</p>\n247\t          </div>\n248\t        </div>\n249\t        <div class=\"tl-item\">\n250\t          <span class=\"tl-year\">2024</span>\n251\t          <div class=\"tl-content\">\n252\t            <h4>全球健康發展協會</h4>\n253\t            <p>公益財源開拓委員會主委</p>\n254\t          </div>\n255\t        </div>\n256\t      </div>\n257\t    </div>\n258\t  </section>\n259\t\n260\t  <!-- 智慧語錄 -->\n261\t  <section class=\"quotes-carousel\" id=\"quotes\">\n262\t    <div class=\"container\">\n263\t      <p class=\"tag center\">智慧語錄</p>\n264\t      <h2 class=\"section-title center\">大樹教練的<span class=\"gold\">經典金句</span></h2>\n265\t\n266\t      <div class=\"carousel-wrapper\">\n267\t        <button class=\"carousel-btn carousel-prev\" id=\"qPrev\">‹</button>\n268\t\n269\t        <div class=\"carousel-viewport\">\n270\t          <div class=\"carousel-track\" id=\"qTrack\">\n271\t\n272\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n273\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n274\t              <p class=\"card-text\">你是誰，決定了別人怎麼看你；而不是，別人怎麼看你，決定了你是誰。</p>\n275\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">自我認同</span>\n276\t            </div>\n277\t\n278\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n279\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n280\t              <p class=\"card-text\">要麼你去駕馭生命，要麼是生命駕馭你。你的心態決定誰是坐騎，誰是騎師。</p>\n281\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">心態掌控</span>\n282\t            </div>\n283\t\n284\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n285\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n286\t              <p class=\"card-text\">開始承認自己不懂不會，就代表開始成長了。</p>\n287\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">成長心態</span>\n288\t            </div>\n289\t\n290\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n291\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n292\t              <p class=\"card-text\">你沒有的東西，你無法給別人。</p>\n293\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">自信心</span>\n294\t            </div>\n295\t\n296\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n297\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n298\t              <p class=\"card-text\">沒有內功，就沒有威力。</p>\n299\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">自信心</span>\n300\t            </div>\n301\t\n302\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n303\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n304\t              <p class=\"card-text\">「誤解」比「不懂」更可怕。</p>\n305\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">學習觀念</span>\n306\t            </div>\n307\t\n308\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n309\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n310\t              <p class=\"card-text\">證明自己是對的，有時候是一種很大的內耗。</p>\n311\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">人生智慧</span>\n312\t            </div>\n313\t\n314\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n315\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n316\t              <p class=\"card-text\">我要證明，這句話不用說，當你做到時就已經証明了。</p>\n317\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">行動力</span>\n318\t            </div>\n319\t\n320\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n321\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n322\t              <p class=\"card-text\">如果你不掌控就會失控。</p>\n323\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">自信心</span>\n324\t            </div>\n325\t\n326\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n327\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n328\t              <p class=\"card-text\">所有的結果都是你同意後的結果。</p>\n329\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">自信心</span>\n330\t            </div>\n331\t\n332\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n333\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n334\t              <p class=\"card-text\">自信是決定，決定完就結束了。</p>\n335\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">自信心</span>\n336\t            </div>\n337\t\n338\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n339\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n340\t              <p class=\"card-text\">自信是 100%，少一點都不是。</p>\n341\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">自信心</span>\n342\t            </div>\n343\t\n344\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n345\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n346\t              <p class=\"card-text\">下決定然後負責任。</p>\n347\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">自信心</span>\n348\t            </div>\n349\t\n350\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n351\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n352\t              <p class=\"card-text\">所有的話都是半句話。</p>\n353\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">溝通智慧</span>\n354\t            </div>\n355\t\n356\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n357\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n358\t              <p class=\"card-text\">你為何而來，就會因何而走。只有一種情況你會一直留下來：你是因為理念相同而來。只要理念不變，你也沒有理由離開。</p>\n359\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">海餅乾俱樂部</span>\n360\t            </div>\n361\t\n362\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n363\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n364\t              <p class=\"card-text\">培育人才，創造奇蹟，做對社會有貢獻的事。</p>\n365\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">海餅乾使命</span>\n366\t            </div>\n367\t\n368\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n369\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n370\t              <p class=\"card-text\">100% 為自己的生命負責。</p>\n371\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">海餅乾守則</span>\n372\t            </div>\n373\t\n374\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n375\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n376\t              <p class=\"card-text\">態度一流、思想積極、高度意願、形象良好、全力以赴、自動自發、凡事付出、最佳狀態、一定準時、每天快樂！</p>\n377\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">海餅乾十條守則</span>\n378\t            </div>\n379\t\n380\t            <div class=\"carousel-card\">\n381\t              <span class=\"card-quote-mark\">❝</span>\n382\t              <p class=\"card-text\">人們經常處於：知道，做不到。我們的目標是：知道，做到。最終的境界要：不知道，做到。</p>\n383\t              <span class=\"card-tag\">知行合一</span>\n384\t            </div>\n385\t\n386\t          </div>\n387\t        </div>\n388\t\n389\t        <button class=\"carousel-btn carousel-next\" id=\"qNext\">›</button>\n390\t      </div>\n391\t\n392\t      <div class=\"carousel-dots\" id=\"qDots\"></div>\n393\t      <div class=\"carousel-nav-bottom\">\n394\t        <button class=\"carousel-nav-btn\" id=\"qPrevBottom\">‹ 上一句</button>\n395\t        <span class=\"carousel-counter\" id=\"qCounter\">1 / 19</span>\n396\t        <button class=\"carousel-nav-btn\" id=\"qNextBottom\">下一句 ›</button>\n397\t      </div>\n398\t    </div>\n399\t  </section>\n400\t\n401\t  <!-- 服務項目 -->\n402\t  <section class=\"services\" id=\"services\">\n403\t    <div class=\"container\">\n404\t      <p class=\"tag center\">核心服務</p>\n405\t      <h2 class=\"section-title center\">找到你的核心競爭力<br><span class=\"gold\">人生每個角色都能發光</span></h2>\n406\t      <div class=\"services-grid\">\n407\t        <div class=\"service-card\">\n408\t          <div class=\"svc-num\">01</div>\n409\t          <h3>企業培訓</h3>\n410\t          <p>為企業量身設計課程，提升團隊溝通力、銷售力與凝聚力。從根源解決問題，讓每位員工發揮最大潛能。</p>\n411\t          <ul>\n412\t            <li>溝通與人際關係</li>\n413\t            <li>業務銷售技巧</li>\n414\t            <li>領導力與團隊建立</li>\n415\t            <li>自我潛能開發</li>\n416\t          </ul>\n417\t          <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"svc-link\">了解更多 →</a>\n418\t        </div>\n419\t        <div class=\"service-card featured\">\n420\t          <div class=\"svc-num\">02</div>\n421\t          <h3>線上課程</h3>\n422\t          <p>隨時隨地學習，25 年精華濃縮成影音課程。從溝通技巧、自信建立到核心競爭力，全方位提升個人價值。</p>\n423\t          <ul>\n424\t            <li>溝通的藝術</li>\n425\t            <li>無與倫比的自信</li>\n426\t            <li>人類六項需求</li>\n427\t            <li>核心競爭力找尋</li>\n428\t          </ul>\n429\t          <a href=\"#courses\" class=\"svc-link\">查看課程 →</a>\n430\t        </div>\n431\t        <div class=\"service-card\">\n432\t          <div class=\"svc-num\">03</div>\n433\t          <h3>個人教練</h3>\n434\t          <p>一對一深度陪伴，針對你的具體困境制定專屬成長方案。從自我認識到行動改變，大樹教練與你同行。</p>\n435\t          <ul>\n436\t            <li>個人職涯規劃</li>\n437\t            <li>人際關係梳理</li>\n438\t            <li>自我潛能探索</li>\n439\t            <li>行動方案設計</li>\n440\t          </ul>\n441\t          <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"svc-link\">預約諮詢 →</a>\n442\t        </div>\n443\t      </div>\n444\t    </div>\n445\t  </section>\n446\t\n447\t  <!-- 線上課程 -->\n448\t  <section class=\"courses\" id=\"courses\">\n449\t    <div class=\"container\">\n450\t      <p class=\"tag center\">線上課程</p>\n451\t      <h2 class=\"section-title center\">25 年精華<br><span class=\"gold\">濃縮成你隨時可學的課程</span></h2>\n452\t      <div class=\"courses-grid\">\n453\t        <div class=\"course-card\">\n454\t          <div class=\"course-cover c1\"><span>溝通<br>的藝術</span></div>\n455\t          <div class=\"course-body\">\n456\t            <div class=\"course-tags\"><span>人際力</span><span>溝通力</span><span>銷售力</span></div>\n457\t            <h3>溝通的藝術</h3>\n458\t            <p>38 分鐘｜掌握溝通核心，讓每一次表達都有效果</p>\n459\t            <div class=\"course-price\"><b>NT$ 1,688</b><s>NT$ 2,980</s></div>\n460\t            <a href=\"https://www.bymyway.com/courses/%e6%ba%9d%e9%80%9a%e7%9a%84%e8%97%9d%e8%a1%93/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-course\">立即購課</a>\n461\t          </div>\n462\t        </div>\n463\t        <div class=\"course-card\">\n464\t          <div class=\"course-cover c2\"><span>無與倫比<br>的自信</span></div>\n465\t          <div class=\"course-body\">\n466\t            <div class=\"course-tags\"><span>競爭力</span></div>\n467\t            <h3>擁有無與倫比的自信</h3>\n468\t            <p>26 分鐘｜從內而外建立不動如山的自信心</p>\n469\t            <div class=\"course-price\"><b>NT$ 1,980</b><s>NT$ 3,980</s></div>\n470\t            <a href=\"https://www.bymyway.com/courses/%e6%93%81%e6%9c%89%e7%84%a1%e8%88%87%e5%80%ab%e6%af%94%e7%9a%84%e8%87%aa%e4%bf%a1/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-course\">立即購課</a>\n471\t          </div>\n472\t        </div>\n473\t        <div class=\"course-card\">\n474\t          <div class=\"course-cover c3\"><span>人類<br>六項需求</span></div>\n475\t          <div class=\"course-body\">\n476\t            <div class=\"course-tags\"><span>人際力</span><span>溝通力</span><span>競爭力</span></div>\n477\t            <h3>人類六項需求</h3>\n478\t            <p>1小時 27分｜了解人性底層需求，掌握人際關鍵</p>\n479\t            <div class=\"course-price\"><b>NT$ 999</b><s>NT$ 2,980</s></div>\n480\t            <a href=\"https://www.bymyway.com/courses/%e4%ba%ba%e9%a1%9e%e5%85%ad%e9%a0%85%e9%9c%80%e6%b1%82/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-course\">立即購課</a>\n481\t          </div>\n482\t        </div>\n483\t        <div class=\"course-card\">\n484\t          <div class=\"course-cover c4\"><span>核心<br>競爭力</span></div>\n485\t          <div class=\"course-body\">\n486\t            <div class=\"course-tags\"><span>競爭力</span></div>\n487\t            <h3>如何找到你的核心競爭力</h3>\n488\t            <p>找到你獨一無二的優勢，在競爭中脫穎而出</p>\n489\t            <div class=\"course-price\"><b>NT$ 2,980</b><s>NT$ 8,600</s></div>\n490\t            <a href=\"https://www.bymyway.com/courses/%e5%a6%82%e4%bd%95%e6%89%be%e5%88%b0%e4%bd%a0%e7%9a%84%e6%a0%b8%e5%bf%83%e7%ab%b6%e7%88%ad%e5%8a%9b/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-course\">立即購課</a>\n491\t          </div>\n492\t        </div>\n493\t        <div class=\"course-card\">\n494\t          <div class=\"course-cover c5\"><span>最佳<br>狀態</span></div>\n495\t          <div class=\"course-body\">\n496\t            <div class=\"course-tags\"><span>人際力</span><span>競爭力</span></div>\n497\t            <h3>如何隨時進入最佳狀態？</h3>\n498\t            <p>掌握狀態切換關鍵，隨時保持巔峰表現</p>\n499\t            <div class=\"course-price\"><b>NT$ 2,980</b><s>NT$ 3,980</s></div>\n500\t            <a href=\"https://www.bymyway.com/courses/%e5%a6%82%e4%bd%95%e9%9a%a8%e6%99%82%e5%85%a5%e6%9c%80%e4%bd%b3%e7%8b%80%e6%85%8b%ef%bc%9f/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-course\">立即購課</a>\n501\t          </div>\n502\t        </div>\n503\t        <div class=\"course-card\">\n504\t          <div class=\"course-cover c6\"><span>擁抱<br>拒絕</span></div>\n505\t          <div class=\"course-body\">\n506\t            <div class=\"course-tags\"><span>銷售力</span></div>\n507\t            <h3>擁抱拒絕俱樂部</h3>\n508\t            <p>35 分鐘｜把拒絕變成你最強大的銷售武器</p>\n509\t            <div class=\"course-price\"><b>NT$ 1,980</b></div>\n510\t            <a href=\"https://www.bymyway.com/courses/%e6%93%81%e6%8a%b1%e6%8b%92%e7%b5%95%e4%bf%b1%e6%a8%82%e9%83%a8/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-course\">立即購課</a>\n511\t          </div>\n512\t        </div>\n513\t      </div>\n514\t      <div class=\"center mt-40\">\n515\t        <a href=\"https://www.bymyway.com/courses\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn-outline\">查看全部課程</a>\n516\t      </div>\n517\t    </div>\n518\t  </section>\n519\t\n520\t  <!-- 企業演講 -->\n521\t  <section class=\"speaking\" id=\"speaking\">\n522\t    <div class=\"container\">\n523\t      <p class=\"tag center\">企業培訓｜活動演講</p>\n524\t      <h2 class=\"section-title center\">邀請大樹教練<br><span class=\"gold\">為你的團隊帶來改變</span></h2>\n525\t      <div class=\"speaking-grid\">\n526\t        <div class=\"speaking-card\">\n527\t          <div class=\"sp-icon\">🎯</div>\n528\t          <h3>溝通與人際關係</h3>\n529\t          <p>有效溝通技巧、人際衝突處理、跨部門協作</p>\n530\t        </div>\n531\t        <div class=\"speaking-card\">\n532\t          <div class=\"sp-icon\">💪</div>\n533\t          <h3>自信與心理建設</h3>\n534\t          <p>建立正向心態、突破自我設限、提升自我效能</p>\n535\t        </div>\n536\t        <div class=\"speaking-card\">\n537\t          <div class=\"sp-icon\">🚀</div>\n538\t          <h3>銷售與業績提升</h3>\n539\t          <p>銷售心理學、拒絕處理技巧、成交率倍增策略</p>\n540\t        </div>\n541\t        <div class=\"speaking-card\">\n542\t          <div class=\"sp-icon\">🌱</div>\n543\t          <h3>潛能開發與成長</h3>\n544\t          <p>發現核心優勢、制定成長路徑、實現人生目標</p>\n545\t        </div>\n546\t        <div class=\"speaking-card\">\n547\t          <div class=\"sp-icon\">👥</div>\n548\t          <h3>團隊領導與激勵</h3>\n549\t          <p>領導力建立、團隊文化塑造、員工激勵方法</p>\n550\t        </div>\n551\t        <div class=\"speaking-card\">\n552\t          <div class=\"sp-icon\">📖</div>\n553\t          <h3>品德教育與傳統文化</h3>\n554\t          <p>以中華傳統文化為核心動力，培育品德與正向價值觀</p>\n555\t        </div>\n556\t      </div>\n557\t      <div class=\"speaking-footer\">\n558\t        <p>已服務超過 <strong>200 家</strong>企業與機構</p>\n559\t        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn-gold\">立即邀約演講</a>\n560\t      </div>\n561\t    </div>\n562\t  </section>\n563\t\n564\t  <!-- 學員見證 -->\n565\t  <section class=\"testimonials\">\n566\t    <div class=\"container\">\n567\t      <p class=\"tag center\">學員見證</p>\n568\t      <h2 class=\"section-title center\">改變就是<span class=\"gold\">這麼簡單</span></h2>\n569\t      <div class=\"testi-grid\">\n570\t        <div class=\"testi-card\">\n571\t          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n572\t          <p>「上完大樹教練的溝通課程後，與客戶的談判成功率提升了至少 40%。課程用最直白的方式讓你真正理解並能立刻應用。」</p>\n573\t          <div class=\"testi-author\">\n574\t            <div class=\"avatar\">林</div>\n575\t            <div><strong>林先生</strong><span>業務經理</span></div>\n576\t          </div>\n577\t        </div>\n578\t        <div class=\"testi-card\">\n579\t          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n580\t          <p>「大樹教練的企業培訓讓整個團隊的凝聚力大幅提升，員工反映是他們參加過最有收穫的培訓課程。強烈推薦！」</p>\n581\t          <div class=\"testi-author\">\n582\t            <div class=\"avatar\">陳</div>\n583\t            <div><strong>陳總經理</strong><span>科技公司</span></div>\n584\t          </div>\n585\t        </div>\n586\t        <div class=\"testi-card\">\n587\t          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n588\t          <p>「從極度缺乏自信，到能夠在 300 人面前演講。大樹教練用他的方式讓我看見自己真正的潛力，這是改變我人生的課程。」</p>\n589\t          <div class=\"testi-author\">\n590\t            <div class=\"avatar\">王</div>\n591\t            <div><strong>王小姐</strong><span>培訓講師</span></div>\n592\t          </div>\n593\t        </div>\n594\t      </div>\n595\t    </div>\n596\t  </section>\n597\t\n598\t  <!-- CTA -->\n599\t  <section class=\"cta-banner\">\n600\t    <div class=\"container cta-inner\">\n601\t      <h2>改變，從現在開始</h2>\n602\t      <p>無論你想提升自己、改變職涯，或為團隊帶來突破<br>大樹教練都在這裡陪你走這一步</p>\n603\t      <div class=\"hero-btns\">\n604\t        <a href=\"#courses\" class=\"btn-gold\">探索課程</a>\n605\t        <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"btn-line\">免費諮詢</a>\n606\t      </div>\n607\t    </div>\n608\t  </sectio