\"testimonials\" id=\"testimonials\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <p class=\"tag center\">學員見證</p>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title center\">改變就是<span class=\"gold\">這麼簡單</span></h2>\n      <div class=\"testi-grid\">\n        <div class=\"testi-card\">\n          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>「上完大樹教練的溝通課程後，與客戶的談判成功率提升了至少 40%。課程用最直白的方式讓你真正理解並能立刻應用。」</p>\n          <div class=\"testi-author\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\">林</div>\n            <div><strong>林先生</strong><span>業務經理</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testi-card\">\n          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>「大樹教練的企業培訓讓整個團隊的凝聚力大幅提升，員工反映是他們參加過最有收穫的培訓課程。強烈推薦！」</p>\n          <div class=\"testi-author\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\">陳</div>\n            <div><strong>陳總經理</strong><span>科技公司</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testi-card\">\n          <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n          <p>「從極度缺乏自信，到能夠在 300 人面前演講。大樹教練用他的方式讓我看見自己真正的潛力，這是改變我人生的課程。」</p>\n          <div class=\"testi-author\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\">王</div>\n            <div><strong>王小姐</strong><span>培訓講師</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>","numLines":35,"startLine":557,"totalLines":696}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"75f495c1-26ec-4816-b204-01f97ef526fa","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/bymyway/.openclaw","sessionId":"e6b7e307-9066-4c35-a6a7-c4be4327d874","version":"2.1.170","gitBranch":"master","slug":"melodic-singing-meadow"}
