{"parentUuid":"918071d6-838d-412a-a420-477153ac88fd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e3b3a4cf-b2b9-4775-b5b1-7a60eb1b3398","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user (大樹教練) is continuing to refine their personal brand website at `/Users/bymyway/github_repos/bymyway-website/`. This session covered: deploying to bymyway.com/coach via WordPress REST API, fixing LINE icon visibility, converting subscription form to LINE button, updating ganjingworld links, adding timeline entries, adding nav menu items, and massively expanding the student testimonials section from 3 fake examples to 20+ real testimonials sourced from ganjingworld posts and LINE screenshots. The coach's most recent and active request is to fix the testimonials carousel to display uniform-sized cards where each testimonial fits completely within one card, with page-based left/right navigation, totaling exactly 20 testimonials.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - WordPress REST API for page creation (iframe embedding with elementor_canvas template)\n   - GitHub Pages deployment (coach1973.github.io/bymyway-website/)\n   - CSS carousel/slider implementation (flexbox translateX approach)\n   - Responsive design (3 cards desktop, 2 tablet, 1 mobile)\n   - position:fixed behavior inside iframes\n   - ganjingworld Next.js __NEXT_DATA__ JSON extraction for post content\n   - Desktop HTML preview workflow (cp to ~/Desktop + open command)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/Users/bymyway/github_repos/bymyway-website/index.html` (~730 lines)\n     - WordPress deployment: iframe at bymyway.com/coach (page ID 27374)\n     - Subscription form replaced with LINE button: `<a href=\"https://lin.ee/o5pODV8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"line-subscribe-btn\">`\n     - Ganjingworld links changed to `https://www.ganjingworld.com/@bymyway`\n     - Timeline: Added 2001 (註冊 bymyway.com) and 2003 (博邁威數位資訊有限公司, 共同創辦人)\n     - Copyright changed to: `Copyright © 1999 – 2026 大樹教育顧問｜海餅乾俱樂部 大樹教練`\n     - Nav: Added `<a href=\"#testimonials\">學員見證</a>` and `<a href=\"https://www.ganjingworld.com/@bymyway\" target=\"_blank\">乾淨世界</a>`\n     - Testimonials section changed from `<div class=\"testi-grid\">` to carousel structure:\n       ```html\n       <div class=\"testi-carousel-wrap\">\n         <button class=\"testi-arrow testi-prev\" id=\"testiPrev\">‹</button>\n         <div class=\"testi-viewport\">\n           <div class=\"testi-track\" id=\"testiTrack\">\n             <!-- 21 testi-cards here -->\n           </div>\n         </div>\n         <button class=\"testi-arrow testi-next\" id=\"testiNext\">›</button>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"testi-dots\" id=\"testiDots\"></div>\n       ```\n     - 21 real testimonials from: 吳秀娟, 劉淑華, 洪瑋澤, 林彥均, 陳新典, FOX, 語薇, 馬詠淇, 鯊魚哥（源坤）, 陳欣 Rara, 俐瑩 Xena Lee, 陳欣佑律師 Yoyo, 陳建宏, 洪嘉妘, 張敬媛 Amy, 呂明麗, 曾誌偉 Wayne, 林晃誼, 嚴宗哲, 學校行政主管 (and one more from ganjingworld)\n     - \"洪嘉坋\" corrected to \"洪嘉妘\"\n\n   - `/Users/bymyway/github_repos/bymyway-website/style.css` (~690 lines)\n     - Subscription form CSS replaced with LINE button styles:\n       ```css\n       .line-subscribe-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 32px; background: #06C755; color: #fff; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; text-decoration: none; }\n       ```\n     - Grid CSS replaced with carousel CSS:\n       ```css\n       .testi-carousel-wrap { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n       .testi-viewport { overflow: hidden; flex: 1; }\n       .testi-track { display: flex; transition: transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1); }\n       .testi-track .testi-card { min-width: calc(33.333% - 14px); margin: 0 7px; box-sizing: border-box; flex-shrink: 0; height: 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }\n       ```\n     - Arrow and dot styles added\n     - Responsive: tablet `min-width: calc(50% - 14px)`, mobile `min-width: calc(100% - 14px)`\n\n   - `/Users/bymyway/github_repos/bymyway-website/main.js` (~150 lines)\n     - handleSubscribe function removed\n     - Testimonial carousel JS added (page-based navigation with auto-play every 5 seconds):\n       ```javascript\n       // 學員見證輪播（翻頁式：一次翻一整頁 + 自動播放）\n       (function() {\n         var track = document.getElementById('testiTrack');\n         var cards = track.querySelectorAll('.testi-card');\n         var total = cards.length;\n         var page = 0;\n         function perView() { /* 3/2/1 based on width */ }\n         function totalPages() { return Math.ceil(total / perView()); }\n         function goTo(p) { /* translateX based on page */ }\n         // auto-play every 5 seconds, circular navigation\n       })();\n       ```\n\n   - WordPress page at bymyway.com/coach:\n     - Page ID: 27374, slug: \"coach\", template: elementor_canvas\n     - Content: `<iframe src=\"https://coach1973.github.io/bymyway-website/\" style=\"width:100%;min-height:4500px;border:none;display:block;\" title=\"大樹教練 DA SHU COACH\"></iframe>`\n     - WordPress credentials: username `bymyway7`, app password `Gqx6 0c9r JRW9 vOgA sxCB 0ywX`\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **WebFetch model error**: WebFetch returned \"There's an issue with the selected model (MiniMax-M3)\" for all 6 ganjingworld URLs. Fixed by using curl + python3 to extract __NEXT_DATA__ JSON from the pages directly.\n   - **LINE icon not visible on bymyway.com**: position:fixed inside iframe doesn't work as expected. Partially addressed by increasing iframe height from 1800px to 4500px. Not fully resolved.\n   - **Subscription form sends data nowhere**: handleSubscribe was purely visual (just changed button text). Fixed by replacing entire form with LINE official account link button.\n   - **Coach rejected first carousel attempt**