會代表 改成 海餅乾俱樂部《打造核心團隊的黃金法則》學員 同時，我剛才截了十幾張學員見証的圖片，你再去下載資料夾整理成見証，非常精彩\" + [pasted school administrator testimonial]\n   - \"洪嘉坋 應是 洪嘉妘 把學員見証的方式改成https://theunrestrictedwar.netlify.app/#testimonials 超限戰觀眾回饋的樣式 就是在同一排可以上一個下一個\"\n   - \"不合格，你自已檢視一下，從每一則都要按好幾下才會到下一個，然後，不到5下就沒了，請認真一點，走高品質的路線，解決學員見証的問題，不要問我，你思考怎麼做比較好，我已經給你方向了\"\n   - \"我要的不是這個，我已經截圖給你，在下載資料夾7869.jpg 我要的就是這樣大小，每個人的見証都在一格之內寫完，然後可以按上一個下一個，共有20格。就是20則見証\"\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - **FIX TESTIMONIALS CAROUSEL (ACTIVE, URGENT)**: Make uniform card height, shorten long testimonials to fit within cards, reduce to exactly 20 cards, page-based navigation (3 per page on desktop)\n   - Push all uncommitted changes to GitHub (timeline, nav, testimonials, carousel)\n   - Update WordPress iframe if needed after push\n   - Update JUNSHI_HANDOFF_LATEST.md before session ends\n\n8. Current Work:\n   The coach rejected the testimonials carousel implementation twice. The latest feedback (with reference screenshot 1781454347869.jpg) requires:\n   - Each of the 20 testimonials must fit completely within one uniform-sized card (no overflow)\n   - Cards should be the size shown in the screenshot (approximately 280px height)\n   - Long testimonials must be shortened/condensed to fit\n   - Currently have 21 testimonials, need to reduce to exactly 20\n   - Page-based carousel: click left/right to see next set of 3 cards\n   - I had just started adding `height: 280px` to `.testi-track .testi-card` in style.css when the summary was requested\n   - The long testimonials (洪瑋澤, 林彥均, 馬詠淇, 鯊魚哥, 張敬媛 Amy, 陳建宏, etc.) need to be shortened to fit within the fixed card height\n   - Need to remove 1 testimonial to get to exactly 20\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Continue fixing the testimonials carousel per the coach's latest instruction: \"每個人的見証都在一格之內寫完，然後可以按上一個下一個，共有20格。就是20則見証\". Specifically:\n   1. Shorten all long testimonials to fit within uniform ~280px card height (about 3-4 lines of text max based on the screenshot)\n   2. Remove 1 testimonial to get exactly 20\n   3. Ensure carousel works with page-based navigation (3 cards per click on desktop)\n   4. Copy to Desktop and open in browser for coach review\n   5. Do NOT use the app preview panel - must use `cp to ~/Desktop + open` workflow\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /Users/bymyway/.claude/projects/-Users-bymyway--openclaw/e6b7e307-9066-4c35-a6a7-c4be4327d874.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened."},"isVisibleInTranscriptOnly":true,"isCompactSummary":true,"uuid":"6281d814-7b8a-407a-bd79-f63c18bb9956","timestamp":"2026-06-14T16:32:34.931Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/bymyway/.openclaw","sessionId":"e6b7e307-9066-4c35-a6a7-c4be4327d874","version":"2.1.170","gitBranch":"master","slug":"melodic-singing-meadow"}
