{"parentUuid":"8eb991a6-a8c7-48f3-a9df-0a3dddb1473c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MU74bWTWYCrLoPWPx85dyK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Wait, I see only 18 names listed, but there are 20 testi-card divs. Let me check more carefully. Actually grep filtered by 海餅乾/學員 etc., so it might have missed some. Let me check what's missing.\n\nActually looking at the grep output, I see 18 names. The grep filtered by keywords, so 曾誌偉 Wayne (AI 導入顧問) and 學校行政主管 might have been filtered out. Let me not worry about that.\n\nThe real issue is: the Desktop copy has 20 cards, but the coach says he only sees 7. \n\nAh, I think I understand now—the coach is probably looking at the carousel page indicators and counting those as the total number of testimonials. Since the carousel displays 3 cards per page, 20 cards would create about 7 pages, which matches what he's seeing. He might think the carousel is broken or that only 7 testimonials exist, when really all 20 are there but spread across multiple pages that he can't scroll through.\n\nThe coach wants single-card navigation instead—clicking next/previous should advance one card at a time, giving him 20 individual steps through all the testimonials rather than jumping 3 cards at a time across 7 pages. to change the carousel to show 1 card at a time on desktop with 20 pages total. But wait—looking back at the reference screenshot he showed me, it actually displayed multiple cards side by side. Maybe what he really wants is the dots to represent all 20 testimonials while the carousel still shows 3 cards visible and slides one at a time, like the quote carousel does. Let me check how that would work with the math—if I'm showing 3 cards at a time and sliding through 20 total, that would give me 18 dots on desktop, not quite 20.\n\nActually, thinking about his earlier feedback—he complained about the first version being single-card navigation because there were only ~5 testimonials back then. Now with 20 testimonials, single-card sliding would naturally give 20 positions to click through. So I should switch it to slide one card at a time while keeping 3 visible on screen, which gives that carousel feel and gets close to the 20 navigation points he's looking for.\n\nActually, the real issue is simpler—the coach sees 7 dots and assumes there are only 7 testimonials. Instead of relying on dots, I should add a counter like \"X / 20\" to make it unmistakably clear there are 20 testimonials total. So I'll switch to single-card navigation, keep 3 cards visible for the sliding effect, and replace the dots with a straightforward counter display.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":851,"cache_read_input_tokens":77735,"output_tokens":2790,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":851,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cc3UfL2AREMckzfVjB8dB","type":"assistant","uuid":"d75ef763-58c3-4509-8aa2-f33b82eefde0","timestamp":"2026-06-14T16:36:38.727Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/bymyway/.openclaw","sessionId":"e6b7e307-9066-4c35-a6a7-c4be4327d874","version":"2.1.170","gitBranch":"master","slug":"melodic-singing-meadow"}
{"parentUuid":"d75ef763-58c3-4509-8aa2-f33b82eefde0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MU74bWTWYCrLoPWPx85dyK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"教練說得對，我看到了問題。底下的圓點顯示 7 頁（因為 3 張一頁 × 7 = 21），教練看到 7 以為只有 7 個。我改成一次滑一張、顯示「第 X / 20 則」計數器，讓 20 則清清楚楚。"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":851,"cache_read_input_tokens":77735,"output_tokens":2790,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":851,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cc3UfL2AREMckzfVjB8dB","type":"assistant","uuid":"8d865640-a4bc-4b74-b1ee-6f75a23e09b6","timestamp":"2026-06-14T16:36:40.389Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/bymyway/.openclaw","sessionId":"e6b7e307-9066-4c35-a6a7-c4be4327d874","version":"2.1.170","gitBranch":"master","slug":"melodic-singing-meadow"}
{"parentUuid":"8d865640-a4bc-4b74-b1ee-6f75a23e09b6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MU74bWTWYCrLoPWPx85dyK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01S4GgH94Fo35iMuQJTdUbeC","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/bymyway/github_repos/bymyway-website/main.js","old_string":"// 學員見證輪播（翻頁式：一次翻一整頁 + 自動播放）\n(function() {\n  var track = document.getElementById('testiTrack');\n  if (!track) return;\n  var cards = track.querySelectorAll('.testi-card');\n  var total = cards.length;\n  var page = 0;\n  var autoTimer;\n\n  function perView() {\n    if (window.innerWidth >= 1024) return 3;\n    if (window.innerWidth >= 768) return 2;\n    return 1;\n  }\n\n  function totalPages() { return Math.ceil(total / perView()); }\n\n  function goTo(p) {\n    var pages = totalPages();\n    page = ((p % pages) + pages) % pages;\n    var pv = perView();\n    var offset = page * pv;\n    if (offset > total - pv) offset = total - pv;\n    track.style.transform = 'translateX(-' + (offset * 100 / pv) + '%)';\n    buildDots();\n  }\n\n  function buildDots() {\n    var c = document.getElementById('testiDots');\n    if (!c) return;\n    var pages = totalPages();\n    if (c.children.length !== pages) {\n      c.innerHTML = '';\n      for (var i = 0; i < pages; i++) {\n        var d = document.createElement('button');\n        d.dataset.i = i;\n        d.addEventListener('click', function() { page = parseInt(this.dataset.i); goTo(page); resetAuto(); });\n        c.appendChild(d);\n      }\n    }\n    Array.from(c.children).forEach(function(d, i) {\n      d.className = i === page ? 'active' : '';\n    });\n  }\n\n  function resetAuto() {\n    clearInterval(autoTimer);\n    autoTimer = setInterval(function() { goTo(page + 1); }, 5000);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('testiNext').addEventListener('click', function() { goTo(page + 1); resetAuto(); });\n  document.getElementById('testiPrev').addEventListener('click', function() { goTo(page - 1); resetAuto(); });\n  window.addEventListener('resize', function() { goTo(page); });\n  goTo(0);\n  resetAuto();\n})();","new_string":"// 學員見證輪播（一次滑一張，顯示 X/20 計數）\n(function() {\n  var track = document.getElementById('testiTrack');\n  if (!track) return;\n  var cards = track.querySelectorAll('.testi-card');\n  var total = cards.length;\n  var idx = 0;\n  var autoTimer;\n\n  function perView() {\n    if (window.innerWidth >= 1024) return 3;\n    if (window.innerWidth >= 768) return 2;\n    return 1;\n  }\n\n  function update() {\n    var pv = perView();\n    if (idx > total - pv) idx = Math.max(0, total - pv);\n    track.style.transform = 'translateX(-' + (idx * 100 / pv) + '%)';\n    var counter = document.getElementById('testiDots');\n    if (counter) counter.textContent = '第 ' + (idx + 1) + ' – ' + Math.min(idx + pv, total) + ' 則，共 ' + total + ' 則見證';\n  }\n\n  function resetAuto() {\n    clearInterval(autoTimer);\n    autoTimer = setInterval(function() {\n      idx = idx >= total - perView() ? 0 : idx + 1;\n      update();\n    }, 4000);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('testiNext').addEventListener('click', function() {\n    if (idx < total - perView()) { idx++; update(); resetAuto(); }\n  });\n  document.getElementById('testiPrev').addEventListener('click', function() {\n    if (idx > 0) { idx--; update(); resetAuto(); }\n  });\n  window.addEventListener('resize', function() { update(); });\n  update();\n  resetAuto();\n})();"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":851,"cache_read_input_tokens":77735,"output_tokens":2790,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":851,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Cc3UfL2AREMckzfVjB8dB","type":